ractical to me, but please consider this _very_ anecdotal evidence.)\r\n\r\nJust mentioning this here in case it's relevant.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/802846205/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/858782137","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200#issuecomment-858782137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200","id":858782137,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1ODc4MjEzNw==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-10T16:51:03Z","updated_at":"2021-06-10T16:51:03Z","body":"Discussed in detail on 2021-06-10 legal team call, regarding some significant differences in the different versions that have been used over the years, including:\r\n\r\nCurrent version from website: https://docs.python.org/3/license.html\r\n\r\nCurrent version from cpython repo: https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/LICENSE\r\n\r\n2001 version from cpython repo: https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/71500c8293a6862894cd657b8e41bbb43db6680d/LICENSE\r\n\r\n@ariel11 and @capfei to add some more details here, for discussion on next legal team call re: whether / what new entries to add.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/858782137/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/859908655","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200#issuecomment-859908655","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200","id":859908655,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg1OTkwODY1NQ==","user":{"login":"capfei","id":5489711,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODk3MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5489711?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei","html_url":"https://github.com/capfei","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/capfei/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-11T21:01:04Z","updated_at":"2021-06-11T21:01:04Z","body":"I tried finding the source of the license via the OSI license discussion group, but those that responded weren't sure either: https://lists.opensource.org/pipermail/license-discuss_lists.opensource.org/2021-February/021916.html.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/859908655/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/867073416","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200#issuecomment-867073416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200","id":867073416,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NzA3MzQxNg==","user":{"login":"ariel11","id":17935946,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTM1OTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17935946?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11","html_url":"https://github.com/ariel11","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-23T18:42:26Z","updated_at":"2021-06-23T18:50:05Z","body":"Per @swinslow's comment above, adding some examples of components in the wild that use a license very close to the \"Python-2.0\" SPDX, but is not a match.\r\n\r\nExample 1\r\n1.\tComponent - https://www.nuget.org/packages/IronPython.StdLib/2.7.8.1\r\n2.\tLicense - https://docs.python.org/3/license.html\r\n3.\tAnalysis – Ran a Word \"Compare\" between above license and the SPDX license text for \"Python-2.0.\"\r\n\r\nThe CNRI portion of the above license.html does not match that section of the “Python-2.0” SPDX.  Interestingly, it does match the “CNRI-Python-GPL-Compatible” SPDX text, however it does not have the click-accept language shown on the “CNRI-Python-GPL-Compatible” SPDX.  \r\n\r\nBesides the CNRI section noted above, the other differences between this license.html example and the “Python-2.0” license are as follows:\r\n(1)\t**Title** of first section is different (this is in colored font, but should perhaps be red instead of blue, meaning it is replaceable (with a different title) and not just omittable).\r\n(2)\tAlso, in that first section, instead of “Python,” throughout it uses “Python 3.9.5.”\r\n(3)\tAlso, in that first section, the copyright dates are different in clause 2.\r\n(4)\tThe CNRI **title** is different (this is in colored font, but should perhaps be red instead of blue, meaning it is replaceable and not just omittable).\r\n(5)\tThe CNRI click-accept language is not included, which is OK per the blue colored font.\r\n(6)\tThere’s an additional “ZERO-CLAUSE BSD LICENSE FOR CODE IN THE PYTHON 3.9.5 DOCUMENTATION” license section at the end.\r\n ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/867073416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/867085632","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200#issuecomment-867085632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1200","id":867085632,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg2NzA4NTYzMg==","user":{"login":"ariel11","id":17935946,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTM1OTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17935946?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11","html_url":"https://github.com/ariel11","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ariel11/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-06-23T19:02:43Z","updated_at":"2021-06-23T19:02:43Z","body":"Example 2\r\n1.\tComponent - https://pypi.org/project/distlib/0.3.2/\r\n2.\tLicense - https://bitbucket.org/pypa/distlib/src/master/LICENSE.txt\r\n3.\tAnalysis – Ran a Word \"Compare\" between above license and the SPDX license text for \"Python-2.0.\"\r\n\r\n(1)\tThe dates in PYTHON SOFTWARE FOUNDATION LICENSE VERSION 2, Section 2 are different.  The bitbucket version has \"2007, 2008, 2009, 2010\" added.\r\n(2)\tThe CNRI section is titled “CNRI LICENSE AGREEMENT FOR PYTHON 1.6.1” (which is different from \"Python-2.0\" text) and it again matches the “CNRI-Python-GPL-Compatible” SPDX text, however it does not have the click-accept language.  Unclear where the CNRI portion of “Python-2.0” is coming from or where it is used.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/867085632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"e